window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c371-d15426641979766f.json"]={sha256:"d15426641979766ff3787da59d8cbf38872736c97c5599fd9c1b5c60b94c7224",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-9a22dd8b5a5ed026","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lro/","title":"Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter — NASA Science","titleEn":"Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c371","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c371","related":[{"id":"c372","referenceUrls":["https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/en/missions/spacecraft/past/kaguya.html"],"title":"Kaguya 月球探測","titleEn":"Kaguya lunar mission","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：若教學場址上限 22% 坡度，名義通過但保守上界失敗，標為需補測。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: With a teaching limit of 22% grade, nominal passes but the conservative bound fails; flag additional measurement. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"以簡化立體影像幾何理解視差誤差如何影響高程精度。","differenceEn":"Use simplified stereo geometry to understand propagation of disparity error into height precision.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成相鄰高程差 12 m、水平間距 60 m，水平距離視為無誤差。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：s=12/60，百分坡度=100s。 結果約 20 %。局部坡度比 s=Δh/Δx；這是尺度依賴的平均值，不代表像元內最大坡度。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學高度 H=100 km、基線 B=20 km、焦距 f=1000 pixel、視差誤差 σd=0.2 pixel。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：σh=100²×0.2/(1000×20) km=0.1 km。 結果約 100 m。近似垂直攝影中 σh≈H²σd/(fB)，f 與 σd 必須使用相同像面單位；不處理遮蔽。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic elevation difference is 12 m over 60 m horizontally, treating horizontal distance as exact. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: s=12/60; percent grade=100s. Result ≈ 20 %. Local slope ratio s=Δh/Δx is a scale-dependent average, not the maximum subpixel slope.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Teaching H=100 km, baseline B=20 km, focal length f=1000 pixels and disparity uncertainty 0.2 pixels. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: σh=100²×0.2/(1000×20) km=0.1 km. Result ≈ 100 m. For near-nadir stereo σh≈H²σd/(fB); f and σd must share image-plane units. Occlusion is excluded.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c381","referenceUrls":["https://global.jaxa.jp/projects/rockets/htv/"],"title":"HTV 太空站補給船","titleEn":"HTV space-station cargo vehicle","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：若教學場址上限 22% 坡度，名義通過但保守上界失敗，標為需補測。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: With a teaching limit of 22% grade, nominal passes but the conservative bound fails; flag additional measurement. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"用一維質心帳比較貨物重排，避免只核對總質量。","differenceEn":"Compare cargo rearrangements with a one-dimensional center-of-mass ledger rather than total mass alone.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成相鄰高程差 12 m、水平間距 60 m，水平距離視為無誤差。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：s=12/60，百分坡度=100s。 結果約 20 %。局部坡度比 s=Δh/Δx；這是尺度依賴的平均值，不代表像元內最大坡度。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學兩件貨物為 200 kg 於 x=1 m，300 kg 於 x=3 m，忽略船體。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：xcg=(200×1+300×3)/500。 結果約 2.2 m。xcg=Σmixi/Σmi；位置須相對同一基準，僅處理靜態質心，不代表完整慣量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic elevation difference is 12 m over 60 m horizontally, treating horizontal distance as exact. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: s=12/60; percent grade=100s. Result ≈ 20 %. Local slope ratio s=Δh/Δx is a scale-dependent average, not the maximum subpixel slope.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Teaching cargo items are 200 kg at x=1 m and 300 kg at x=3 m, excluding vehicle structure. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: xcg=(200×1+300×3)/500. Result ≈ 2.2 m. xcg=Σmixi/Σmi requires one reference datum and describes static center of mass, not full inertia.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-bc3a5e7be5e6658e","url":"https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/en/missions/spacecraft/past/kaguya.html","title":"JAXA ISAS KAGUYA","titleEn":"JAXA ISAS KAGUYA","publisher":"JAXA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-fcbec2e31c34f150","url":"https://global.jaxa.jp/projects/rockets/htv/","title":"JAXA HTV KOUNOTORI","titleEn":"JAXA HTV KOUNOTORI","publisher":"JAXA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
